OL,3,GNEWSANew guidance to help support
OL,4,Astudent mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new guide has been published to
OL,7,Fsupport staff and student mental health
OL,8,Fat schools and colleges across
OL,9,Fsouth-east England.
OL,11,FThe guidance was developed by
OL,12,Fresearchers at the University of Sussex
OL,13,Fin collaboration with Health Innovation
OL,14,FKent, Surrey, Sussex.
OL,16,FIt has been produced in response to an
OL,17,Fincrease in mental health cases in
OL,18,Fschool-aged children, with NHS doctors
OL,19,Frecently warning there had been a sharp
OL,20,Frise in the number attending A&E units
OL,21,Fin England in crisis.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
