OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew guidance to help support
OL,4,Astudent mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Kathryn Lester, from the University
OL,7,Fof Sussex, said the guidance came about
OL,8,Fafter "a significant gap" was
OL,9,Fidentified in the support for governors
OL,10,Fand trustees, who were often
OL,11,F"navigating complex territory without
OL,12,Fclear guidance".
